{"type":"message","id":"2487d2e4","parentId":"a1212f7f","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:50:27.659Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 16:50 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为 Executor Subagent，分析3个网站的页面结构：\n\n1. 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局: http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n2. 厦门科学技术局: http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/\n3. 福建省科技厅: http://www.fujian.gov.cn/xwdt/fjyw/ (这是实际公告来源)\n\n对于每个网站：\n1. 使用 Playwright 访问页面\n2. 找到公告列表的容器元素（ul/ol/div）\n3. 找到每个公告项（li/div）\n4. 记录：容器CSS选择器、公告项CSS选择器、标题元素选择器、链接选择器\n5. 截图保存\n\n输出格式：\n## 网站名\n- 列表容器选择器: xxx\n- 公告项选择器: xxx  \n- 标题元素选择器: xxx\n- 链接选择器: xxx\n- 页面层级结构（简述）\n\n保存到：~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/页面结构分析-2026-03-14.md"}],"timestamp":1773478227658}}
{"type":"message","id":"37485989","parentId":"2487d2e4","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:51:09.831Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求我分析3个政府网站的页面结构，找出公告列表的CSS选择器。这是一个耗时操作，需要使用Playwright访问页面。\n\n我需要：\n1. 创建输出目录（如果不存在）\n2. 编写Python脚本使用Playwright访问3个网站\n3. 分析页面结构，找出选择器\n4. 截图保存\n5. 将结果写入指定的markdown文件\n\n让我先创建目录并编写脚本。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"我来分析这3个政府网站的页面结构。首先创建输出目录和编写分析脚本。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_90f95823528b4643afb1d241","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773478227659}}
