EARNINGS.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting  311743  3月 14 16:54 ______________screenshot.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting  400897  3月 14 16:54 ________screenshot.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting  315043  3月 14 16:54 _______screenshot.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting 1519275  3月 14 15:44 screenshot_______.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting 1088418  3月 14 15:44 screenshot________.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting  311743  3月 14 15:43 screenshot______________.png\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 yankeeting yankeeting    4438  3月 14 15:46 test-2026-03-14.md","cwd":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773478522038}}
{"type":"message","id":"6b4ebd6a","parentId":"a61f688c","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:55:57.637Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"截图已保存。现在我需要生成一份更详细的分析报告，并写入指定的文件。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00547ecb6d4341c9820d7f4a","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/yankeeting/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/页面结构分析-2026-03-14.md","content":"# 政府网站公告页面结构分析\n\n**分析日期**: 2026-03-14\n\n---\n\n## 厦门市人力资源和社会保障局\n\n**URL**: http://hrss.xm.gov.cn/xygk/tzgg/\n\n- **列表容器选择器**: `div.list`\n- **公告项选择器**: `li.b-free-read-leaf`\n- **标题元素选择器**: `span` (包含日期前缀如 `[2026-02-10]`)\n- **链接选择器**: `li.b-free-read-leaf a`\n- **页面层级结构**:\n  ```\n  div.list (容器)\n  └── ul (隐式)\n      └── li.b-free-read-leaf (公告项)\n          ├── span (日期)\n          └── a (链接+标题)\n  ```\n- **截图**: `______________screenshot.png`\n- **备注**: 页面有分页，当前只分析第一页\n\n---\n\n## 厦门科学技术局\n\n**URL**: http://sti.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/\n\n- **列表容器选择器**: `div.list_base` 或 `[class*=\"list\"]`\n- **公告项选择器**: `li` (无特定class)\n- **标题元素选择器**: `a` (链接本身包含标题)\n- **链接选择器**: `div.list_base li a`\n- **页面层级结构**:\n  ```\n  div.list_base.list_base_date_01 (容器)\n  └── ul\n      └── li\n          └── a (链接+标题文本)\n  ```\n- **截图**: `________screenshot.png`\n- **备注**: 公告列表有20个链接，标题直接在 `<a>` 标签内\n\n---\n\n## 福建省科技厅\n\n**URL**: http://www.fujian.gov.cn/xwdt/fjyw/\n\n- **列表容器选择器**: `div.gl_list3`\n- **公告项选择器**: `li.b-free-read-leaf`\n- **标题元素选择器**: 需要进一步分析（可能是 `a` 标签）\n- **链接选择器**: `div.gl_list3 li a`\n- **页面层级结构**:\n  ```\n  div.gl_list3 (容器)\n  └── ul\n      └── li.b-free-read-leaf\n          └── a (链接)\n  ```\n- **截图**: `_______screenshot.png`\n- **备注**: 这是福建省科技厅的实际公告来源页面\n\n---\n\n## 总结\n\n| 网站 | 容器选择器 | 公告项选择器 | 标题选择器 |\n|------|-----------|-------------|-----------|\n| 厦门市人社局 | `div.list` | `li.b-free-read-leaf` | `span` |\n| 厦门科技局 | `div.list_base` | `li` | `a` |\n| 福建省科技厅 | `div.gl_list3` | `li.b-free-read-leaf` | `a` |\n\n### 通用选择器建议\n- 容器: `div[class*=\"list\"]` 或 `div.list`\n- 公告项: `li` 或 `li.b-free-read-leaf`\n- 链接/标题: `li a`, `li.b-free-read-leaf a`\n\n### 截图文件\n- 厦门市人社局: `______________screenshot.png`\n- 厦门科技局: `________screenshot.png`\n- 福建省科技厅: `_______screenshot.png`"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773478522040}}
