{"type":"message","id":"5b2df8a6","parentId":"69bae4c6","timestamp":"2026-03-14T08:56:23.565Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"任务完成了。让我整理一下结果，向主Agent汇报。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 任务完成 ✅\n\n已完成3个政府网站公告页面结构的分析，结果保存到：\n`~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/adaptive-announcement-scraper/.learnings/页面结构分析-2026-03-14.md`\n\n### 分析结果汇总\n\n| 网站 | 列表容器选择器 | 公告项选择器 | 标题元素选择器 |\n|------|---------------|-------------|---------------|\n| **厦门市人力资源和社会保障局** | `div.list` | `li.b-free-read-leaf` | `span` |\n| **厦门科学技术局** | `div.list_base` | `li` | `a` |\n| **福建省科技厅** | `div.gl_list3` | `li.b-free-read-leaf` | `a` |\n\n### 关键发现\n1. **厦门市人社局**: 公告项有 `b-free-read-leaf` class，标题在 span 里带日期前缀\n2. **厦门科技局**: 结构最清晰，标题直接在 `<a>` 标签内，包含20条公告\n3. **福建省科技厅**: 页面有 `gl_list3` class，结构与厦门市人社局类似\n\n### 截图文件\n- `______________screenshot.png` (厦门市人社局)\n- `________screenshot.png` (厦门科技局)\n- `_______screenshot.png` (福建省科技厅)"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773478557647}}
